SUMMARY: Tuesday Organ Recitals
DESCRIPTION:The St. James Cathedral Organ Recitals series on Tuesdays at 
 1:00 PM features some of the region’s finest organists and the powerful s
 ounds of the Cathedral’s 5\,000 organ pipes. Concerts begin at 1:00 pm an
 d last about 40 minutes. Admission is free\, and donations are encouraged
 . All are welcome!\n\n—-\n\nWe invite you to enjoy the performances we’ve
  shared on our YouTube channel https://www.youtube.com/c/StJamesCathedral
 Toronto — it’s a great opportunity to revisit the beautiful music we’ve e
 xperienced together!\n\n—-\n\nMark your calendars for the following recit
 als:\n\nMay:\n\nTuesday\, May 5: William Lupton (St. Martin-in-the-Fields
  London ON)\n\nTuesday\, May 12: Adam MacNeil (Trinity College\, U of T)\
 n\nTuesday\, May 19: William O’Meara (Toronto)\n\nTuesday\, May 26: Kirk 
 Adsett (St. Clements Anglican Church\, Toronto)\n\nDonate here https://ww
 w.eventbrite.ca/e/organ-recitals-tickets-703291613147
CATEGORIES:#torontoevents,#organ,#organrecitals,#music
