SUMMARY: Act 3 Theater - Motherlode
DESCRIPTION:Join Act 3 Theatre in the PAL Green Room for their newest pro
 duction -- Motherlode.\n\nHear new\, humorous and provocative stories fro
 m Julie Burris\, Beth Anne Cole\, Rita Shelton Deverell\, Heather Dick\, 
 Michele George\, Elva Mai Hoover\, Marianne McIsaac\, Jorie Morrow\, Dawn
  Obokata\, Morrie Sinkins\, Nancy Stewart\, Brenda Somers\, Joy Vertes\, 
 Heather Cherron von Atzigen and Marni Walsh.\n\nThe running time of the p
 roduction is 75 minutes.\n\nTickets are $15.00 at the door (CASH only). C
 ash refreshments.\n\nSooner or later\, we all quote our mothers!
