SUMMARY: Family Fun Night
DESCRIPTION:May 22 at 6:00pm: Family Fun Night at St. James\n\nMark your 
 calendars and join St. James Cathedral for a Family Fun Night!\n\nPlease 
 RSVP here https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeMOyP7JwMBaT1FOBo8El-
 scdi1SVC_d9so-bHudx1zvZAe7w/viewform\n\nFriday\, May 22\, from 6:00pm to 
 8:00pm at St. James Cathedral Event Centre (65 Church St\, Toronto\, ON M
 5C 2E9)\n\nTheme: Pajama Party and Movie Night\n\nFamilies\, children\, a
 nd youth of all ages are invited to join for an evening of fun\, food\, a
 nd fellowship! Dinner and light refreshments provided.\n\nIt is a wonderf
 ul opportunity to connect with other families in the community and in the
  church community while having a blast building together! Open to all.\n\
 nFor more information\, please contact Karyne Whalen\, Children\, Youth\,
  and Family Minister\, at kwhalen@stjamescathedral.ca mailto:kwhalen@stja
 mescathedral.ca
